<title>USA: Witco Corp names Camillo DiFrancesco CFO.</title>
<headline>Witco Corp names Camillo DiFrancesco CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Witco Corp said on Wednesday its board of directors confirmed the appointment of Camillo DiFrancesco as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Witco said in a statement both DiFrancesco and David Verner, group vice president of OS1 Specialties, were named corporate officers.</p>
<p>DiFrancesco had been named CFO-designate in August.</p>
<p>He joined Witco after its acquisition last October of OS1 Specialities, where he was vice president and CFO.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, 859 1610</p>
</text>
